ir.deployment.fingerprint_after,updates: ir.deployment.updates}); print("Interpretation: consumers can plot loss and exact-match accuracy while also explaining each prediction from context IDs, similarities, and contributions. The IR transports bounded evidence; it is not a renderer, transformer trace, or production evaluation standard."); ok(1)
